<title>PORTUGAL: Bank of Portugal injects 50 bln esc, 7.2556 pct.</title>
<headline>Bank of Portugal injects 50 bln esc, 7.2556 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Portugal said it injected 50 billion escudos of seven-day funds into the money market at a weighted average rate of 7.2556 percent in a variable rate repurchase tender.</p>
<p>The rate compared with 7.2500 percent this morning.</p>
<p>It offered 50 billion escudos at the repo which takes effect on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- LISBON BUREAU 3511-3538254</p>
</text>
